ents"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":30,"description":"Steam Workshop"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":17,"description":"Includes level editor"},{"id":41,"description":"Remote Play on Phone"},{"id":42,"description":"Remote Play on Tablet"},{"id":43,"description":"Remote Play on TV"},{"id":44,"description":"Remote Play Together"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"35720","steamName":"Trine 2: Complete Story","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/35720/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:04:00.219771+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Three heroes make their way through a fairytale world of forgotten ruins, scheming goblins and impossible contraptions. Play alone and switch between wizard, knight and thief at will, or bring up to two friends, in online or local co-op.","detailedDescription":"Three heroes, one artifact\n\nAmadeus the Wizard conjures boxes and planks out of thin air. Pontius the Knight charges through what stands in the way. Zoya the Thief slips past it with rope and arrow. \n\nPlay together, or on your own\n\n1–3 players, in online or local co-op, and the whole campaign works either way. Play alone and switch heroes freely, or bring two friends and watch each of them reach for a different answer.\n\nPuzzles with more than one answer\n\nTwenty levels of physics-based puzzles, hazards, enemies and contraptions. Turn goblins to ice with frost arrows, levitate a monster to a great height and then trap it in a box, fly across a chasm on the Kitesail Shield, or slow the world down with the time-bending gravity bubble.\n\nA fairytale world worth the trip\n\nTravel through a castle by the treacherous sea, a burning desert, snowy ice mountains, and all the way to the insides of a giant worm.\n\nFeatures\n\n• \n 1–3 player co-op, online and local\n\n• \n Play as wizard, knight and thief, switching freely at any time\n\n• \n Twenty levels of puzzles, platforming and combat, including the Goblin Menace expansion campaign\n\n• \n Award-winning soundtrack by Ari Pulkkinen","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/header.jpg?t=1789543075"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/a9e6f349dfbef3d413f72caaf8f228f0449ed8c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1789543075"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/ss_acfd5a377d7967954f4e8274cd067197fb990f45.600x338.jpg?t=1789543075","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/ss_acfd5a377d7967954f4e8274cd067197fb990f45.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789543075"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/ss_8170211533230984fa79d56b5059fa96a279b7b7.600x338.jpg?t=1789543075","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/ss_8170211533230984fa79d56b5059fa96a279b7b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789543075"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/ss_73830e2bfedcea99edc0203a52f5d6dbc3bdd95a.600x338.jpg?t=1789543075","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/ss_73830e2bfedcea99edc0203a52f5d6dbc3bdd95a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789543075"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/35720/ss_7fc792acc1f7f3e74f6392b85d40c86d126ea8f2.600x338.jpg?t=1789543075","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a